  "description": "FSMapper is a lightweight, fast, and flexible object-to-object mapper for .NET.\nIt supports auto-mapping, manual configuration with .ForMember(), and nested object mapping.\nUse .Ignore() to skip destination properties or .ConvertUsing() for custom value transformations.\nIdeal for mapping between DTOs, entities, and view models with minimal setup.\nNo external dependencies — pure C# and easy to extend.",
